  "description": "Retention of existing portakabins to the rear and front of the site as Class E (g) (i) offices in association with vehicle parking for coaches, retention of storage containers and floodlights to the rear of the site, retention of fencing, relocation of x1 storage container to the front of the site for a period of 3 years\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;All vehicle movements to and from the site shall be limited to between the hours of 0700 and 0000.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;REASON: To ensure that the use operates in a satisfactory manner and does not unduly disturb adjoining occupiers or prejudice local amenity generally.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The proposed uses and buildings hereby permitted shall be retained for a limited period of three years from the date of this permission. At the expiry of the three year period the use shall cease, the buildings removed and the land restored to its former condition.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To allow the site to be comprehensively redeveloped in accordance with development plan policies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding what is shown on the approved plans, detailed design of the secure parking for 10 cycles serving the development site shall be submitted and approved by the Local Planning Authority, within 2 months of the date of this permission. .&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure that a reasonable provision is made within the site for the parking of bicycles in the interest of relieving congestion in surrounding streets and improving highway conditions in general.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
